    {
      "_id": "CN6TB42YKO2exyje",
      "name": "Keeper",
      "type": "class",
      "img": "icons/svg/temple.svg",
      "system": {
        "category": "calling",
        "identifier": "calling-keeper",
        "source": "Callings",
        "tags": [
          "calling",
          "keeper",
          "soul"
        ],
        "description": {
          "value": "<p><em>\"The dead are fine. It's the living who need tending.\"</em></p><p><strong>Keeper</strong> is the Soul Calling \u2014 the trade that kept its bearers alive after the Shattering. Umbrella: priest, ritualist, medium, hedge-warden, funeral speaker. A profession is a flavor label on the Calling.</p><p><strong>Knack \u2014 Hearthlight:</strong> Allies within near range add <strong>+1 Resolve</strong> (+2 at Tier III). The congregation stands straighter when the Keeper is present.</p><p><strong>Aptitude kit:</strong> signature aptitude <strong>Faith</strong> rank = tier; secondary <strong>Insight</strong> rank = tier \u2212 1.</p><p><strong>Services:</strong> a standard job costs the tier fee (T1 10 / T2 30 / T3 90 / T4 270 marks), paid in <strong>Soft Power</strong> marks. Cross-pool \u00d71.5 friction applies as usual.</p><p><strong>Tiers:</strong> Apprentice \u2192 Initiate \u2192 Master \u2192 Archon. Grant the matching tier features alongside this class item.</p><p><strong>Awakens into:</strong> Pactkeeper or Dreamwalker. A Steward is a Calling that ignited into a Path \u2014 Surge is the mark of Stewardship, which is why no Calling banks or spends it.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        }
      },
